[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>A vision.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>Long ago, the Stranger came for the Gem of Immortality.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>The sword strikes the Gem. The shards fly.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>The blade breaks with it.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>You fall, and the world folds shut behind you.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>You wake where you started, remembering. That is a loop. Your level goes back to 1; your skills go with it.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>Some of us remember. We keep the League, and we are looking for the pieces.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>What you keep: the League, your recipes, your achievements, your guild ranks.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>This was only a vision. Nothing about you has changed. Yet.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
[  183.2]   gump <CENTER><BASEFONT COLOR=#F0F0F0>Take the moongate at the end of the dock.</BASEFONT></CENTER>
